```bell
partition(
    @llll ## int/llll (required)
    @mode 0
    @distinct 0
) -> llll
```

Computes the integer partition of the incoming non-negative number or the partition of the incoming set. 

Integer partition are often displayed in Young diagrams. The integer partition algorithm is inspired by the iterative algorithm exposed in [Jerome Kelleher](http://jeromekelleher.net/generating-integer-partitions.html).
)#
partition = (
    $llll = 5, $mode = 0, $distinct = 0 -> (
        init $partition = {bach.partition};
        $msgs = ['mode' $mode] ['distinct' $distinct];
        for $msg in $msgs with @unwrap 1 do $partition($msg @out 'm');
        $partition($llll) 
    ) 
);
